id=BitPerfect.module
name=BitPerfect Universal Audio Engine
version=v5.5.7-Universal
versionCode=557
author=Kostyantyn Matviyevskyy aka kostyamat & Antigravity (c)2026
description=Bit-to-bit audio for QF001/K706: 24-bit/48 kHz path at 0 dB, volume and effects on BU32107 only. One playback output per PCM, raw unprocessed microphone for wDSP (no DP), navigation ducking, call microphone with headroom and echo cancellation on SIM (handsfree CVS) and BT calls without forced communication mode.
